      },
      "description": "For one proposal or agreement of a Hypha space, tell whether the signed-in user has voted, how, and whether they can still vote (with the reason if not). It works for any proposal or agreement slug the user may see. It reports only the user’s own vote, never anyone else’s. \`canVote: true\` means the open window, membership and voting power allow it; it is not a guarantee that a vote would succeed. Never guess a slug: find the space with \`hypha_list_spaces\` and \`query\`, then the proposal with \`hypha_list_proposals\`. A space or proposal the user may not see is reported as not found. Read-only: this tool never casts a vote.",
      "execution": undefined,
      "icons": undefined,
      "inputSchema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "properties": {
          "documentSlug": {
            "description": "The slug of the proposal or agreement, as returned by \`hypha_list_proposals\`.",
            "maxLength": 255,
            "minLength": 1,
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]*$",
            "type": "string",
          },
          "spaceSlug": {
            "description": "The space slug, as returned by \`hypha_list_spaces\`.",
            "maxLength": 120,
            "minLength": 1,
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]*$",
            "type": "string",
          },
        },
        "required": [
          "spaceSlug",
